---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';
const schema = { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'AboutPage', name: 'About Sell My Junk Car TX', url: 'https://sellmyjunkcartx.com/about', about: { '@type': 'LocalBusiness', name: 'Sell My Junk Car TX', telephone: '+1-832-622-2792', areaServed: 'Houston, Texas' } };
---
<BaseLayout title="About Sell My Junk Car TX | Houston Vehicle Buyer" description="Learn how Sell My Junk Car TX approaches immediate vehicle purchases with clear valuation, documentation support and pickup in Houston." canonical="/about" image="/assets/img/process-handover-v2.webp" schema={schema}>
  <PageHero eyebrow="About the company" title="A simpler way to sell the car." description="Sell My Junk Car TX focuses on immediate vehicle purchases, valuation, documentation support and local pickup." pageName="About" image="/assets/img/process-handover-v2.webp" imageAlt="Car key and transfer paperwork on a vehicle hood at a Houston tow yard" />
  <section class="section"><div class="container benefit-layout"><div class="benefit-copy reveal"><h2>Where others see a problem, the process looks for value.</h2><p>The service is built for used, damaged, wrecked and non-running vehicles in Houston.</p><div class="benefit-list"><div class="benefit-item"><strong>Valuation</strong><span>A preliminary quote followed by vehicle verification.</span></div><div class="benefit-item"><strong>Documentation</strong><span>Support with the paperwork required for transfer.</span></div><div class="benefit-item"><strong>Pickup</strong><span>Towing arranged when needed and applicable.</span></div><div class="benefit-item"><strong>Payment</strong><span>Made at handover after documentation is verified.</span></div></div></div><div class="benefit-media reveal"><img src="/assets/img/hero-tow-pickup.webp" alt="Vehicle pickup being reviewed by a tow truck operator" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" /></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section-soft"><div class="narrow prose"><h2>A simplified purchase</h2><p>The company describes its purpose as changing how people sell vehicles by reducing paperwork, arranging towing where applicable and bringing the sale process to the vehicle location.</p><h2>Claims treated carefully</h2><p>The previous site included large volume and speed claims. Because the supplied information does not independently verify them, this site does not present those claims as proof.</p></div></section>
  <CTASection title="Tell us about the vehicle." text="Start with the details you know today." />
</BaseLayout>
